Video Music Awards, which I
believe are next Wednesday.

10:45.500 --> 10:47.500
They're all time favorite and
I've met these guys.

10:47.500 --> 10:50.500
They are great, broke, bunch of
musicians, very, very talented.

10:50.500 --> 10:51.500
Is Good Charlotte.

10:51.500 --> 10:53.500
Check out their new one,
Predictable.

